onal config is .temp/resume-20260916/task-board.config.json. Keep validation proportional and reuse exact accepted evidence where identities match. Report exact unsupported lifecycle constraint rather than bypassing it.\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n## Evidence and Safety\\\\n\\\\n- Add/update a task-scoped outcome named `TASK-260908-34gi0y_*` before handoff:\\\\n  `task-board m 'add_resource(TASK-260908-34gi0y, name=TASK-260908-34gi0y_results.md, content=\\\\\\\"...\\\\\\\", type=outcome, description=\\\\\\\"Handoff evidence\\\\\\\")'`\\\\n- Gating, refusing, validating, authorizing, or attesting behavior ships with negative tests that fail when the gate admits what it must reject; prove the bound by narrowing it, not only by deleting it, and name the production call site. Shapes and incidents: `references/negative-evidence.md`.\\\\n- An absence and a failure to read are different facts; report unknown instead of inferring a property from a proxy signal.\\\\n- Stop-The-Line only for an evidence-backed external blocker or unresolved human-only product/platform/architecture/approval decision. Persist evidence, failed attempts, options/tradeoffs, recommendation, and exact input needed; otherwise rework autonomously.\\\\n- `to-review` is a role handoff, not accepted completion. Report **ready for review** or **handed off to review**.\\\\n\\\\n## LAST — Run For Role Handoff\\\\n\\\\nAfter AC, checklist, validation, and outcome evidence:\\\\n\\\\n```bash\\\\ntask-board handoff TASK-260908-34gi0y --role developer\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n## Working Directory\\\\nBoard directory: `/Users/iv/Developer/relux-tunnel/.task-board`\\\\n\\\\nWork in the project root. Never edit board files directly.\\\\n\\\"}}\\n8:{\\\"schema_version\\\":1,\\\"id\\\":\\\"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c357\\\",\\\"stream\\\":{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"session\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"01a0a809-8791-7622-9a9b-78a086ec7f4f\\\"},\\\"sequence\\\":6,\\\"recorded_at\\\":1780531400000007,\\\"record_type\\\":\\\"event\\\",\\\"durabi